  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/2042326d26ec7b593e52bbbdd22d890b59b1e59f92be81a7235509e9af1c4625.png] \n\nBy using **BODMAS **rule.\n\n \n \n\n Sign\n -\n +\n \n \n\n Interchanged sign\n ÷ \n × \n \n \n\n \n\n**Option 1) :**\n\n**⇒ 32 × 21 + 9 ÷ 184 - 8 = 198**\n\n**After interchanging of signs :**\n\n**⇒ 32 + 21 × 9 - 184 ÷ 8 = 198**\n\n**⇒ 32 + 21 × 9 - 23 = 198**\n\n**⇒ 32 + 189 - 23 = 198**\n\n**⇒ 221 - 23 = 198**\n\n⇒ **198 = 198 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption 2) :\n\n⇒ 32 + 21 - 9 × 184 ÷ 8 = 198\n\nAfter interchanging of signs :\n\n​⇒ 32 × 21 ÷ 9 + 184 - 8 = 198\n\n​⇒ 32 × 2.33 + 184 - 8 = 198\n\n​⇒ 74.66 + 184 - 8 = 198\n\n​⇒ 258.66 - 8 = 198\n\n​⇒ 250.66 ≠ 198 (LHS ≠ RHS )\n\nOption 3) :\n\n⇒ 32 ÷ 21 + 9 - 184 × 8 = 198\n\nAfter interchanging of signs :\n\n⇒ 32 - 21 × 9 ÷ 184 + 8 = 198\n\n⇒ 32 - 21 × 0.0489 + 8 = 198\n\n⇒ 32 - 1.0271 + 8 = 198\n\n⇒ 40 - 1.0271 = 198\n\n⇒ 38.972 ≠ 198 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) :\n\n⇒ 32 + 21 × 9 - 184 ÷ 8 = 198\n\nAfter interchanging of signs :\n\n⇒ 32 × 21 + 9 ÷ 184 - 8 = 198\n\n⇒ 32 × 21 + 0.0489 - 8 = 198\n\n⇒ 672 + 0.0489 - 8 = 198\n\n⇒ 672.0489 - 8 = 198\n\n⇒ 664.0489 ≠ 198 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nThus, the correct answer is **\"Option 1\"**.\n\n48:T179f",
